RAP aims to contract with both individual providers and retained agencies for flexible, responsive and high-quality creative support. \nThe Creative Services Framework has 3 distinct lots: Graphic Design & Artworking (Lot 1), Video, Animation & Photography (Lot 2), Brand & Campaign Development (Lot 3). It is acceptable for a supplier to sit within multiple Lots. \nThe fast-paced nature of our campaigns and activities requires a trusted pool of creative suppliers capable of delivering high-impact work on short timelines. This ITT follows a pre-market engagement (April 2025) and reflects the needs and structure informed by that exercise.\nTo view this notice, please click here: \nhttps://www.delta-esourcing.com/delta/viewNotice.html?noticeId=987052115"},{"code":"en","field_id":"BT-702(a)-notice","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPP-012-notice","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2025-10-22T12:05:22+01:00"},{"code":"UK6","field_id":"OPP-070-notice","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-GB-PPON-PCTJ-5948-ZJZV"}]},{"kind":"LotResult","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"RES-1-1","values":[{"field_id":"BT-13713-LotResult","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"1"},{"code":"selec-w","field_id":"BT-142-LotResult","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-1451-LotResult","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2025-10-14T00:00:00+01:00"},{"field_id":"OPT-320-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-1-0"},{"field_id":"OPT-320-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":1,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-1-1"},{"field_id":"OPT-320-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":2,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-1-2"},{"field_id":"OPT-320-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":3,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"TEN-1-3"},{"field_id":"OPT-320-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":4,"scheme":null,"ty